WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.320
Episode 35

01:33.220 --> 01:34.100
Honey,

01:34.100 --> 01:35.050
the gifts for my family

01:35.050 --> 01:36.130
are almost ready.

01:36.130 --> 01:37.290
Let's head back.

01:37.310 --> 01:39.810
No, we need to buy more for the visit.

01:41.210 --> 01:42.650
Look at this.

01:43.740 --> 01:44.830
Pack some for me.

01:44.850 --> 01:46.290
Alright.

01:55.570 --> 01:56.570
Honey.

01:56.570 --> 01:58.550
- Buy some candied treats for me.
- Sure.

01:58.550 --> 01:59.900
I'll go check on Aman and Long Dan

01:59.900 --> 02:00.980
and see how they're doing.

02:00.980 --> 02:02.420
Hurry up.

02:06.370 --> 02:07.210
I'll try one, okay?

02:07.210 --> 02:08.650
Sure, go ahead.

02:08.980 --> 02:10.420
This one.

02:13.980 --> 02:15.690
Why are you back again?

02:16.420 --> 02:17.620
If you continue with your plans

02:17.620 --> 02:18.910
to harm Dazhou,

02:18.930 --> 02:20.690
I will never allow it.

02:21.490 --> 02:22.930
Greetings, Saintess.

02:24.090 --> 02:25.170
How do you know?

02:25.190 --> 02:26.470
You forged the bamboo leaf letter

02:26.470 --> 02:28.280
that ordered the Nightingale

02:28.370 --> 02:30.070
to return to Nanwu, right?

02:30.090 --> 02:32.030
I went back and asked the Grand Elder.

02:32.050 --> 02:33.190
The Grand Elder didn't write

02:33.210 --> 02:34.400
that bamboo leaf letter.

02:34.420 --> 02:36.220
Only the Saintess knows

02:36.460 --> 02:38.600
the secret of the bamboo leaf letter

02:38.740 --> 02:40.160
and can imitate her handwriting.

02:40.180 --> 02:41.630
I came back this time

02:41.650 --> 02:43.310
to ask you to return to Nanwu.

02:43.330 --> 02:45.030
Please return to Nanwu asap.

02:45.050 --> 02:46.210
I won't go with you.

02:46.210 --> 02:47.650
I will wait for you.

02:55.400 --> 02:59.920
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

03:00.650 --> 03:02.090
(Mingyue, )

03:02.620 --> 03:04.500
(I'd never regretted)

03:04.620 --> 03:07.060
(what I did.)

03:08.370 --> 03:12.180
(But I regret it now.)

03:13.210 --> 03:14.650
(Why did I ask)

03:15.250 --> 03:18.020
(for the marriage edict for you?)

03:19.460 --> 03:22.220
(You died because of it.)

03:29.980 --> 03:31.500
Mingyue,

03:33.980 --> 03:36.250
I know you haven't left.

03:37.020 --> 03:39.810
You're in heaven, watching over me.

03:41.370 --> 03:45.220
Mingyue, don't worry.

03:45.620 --> 03:47.320
I'll make sure to complete

03:47.340 --> 03:49.900
the things you left unfinished.

03:51.090 --> 03:53.510
I'll have that wretched couple

03:53.530 --> 03:55.900
suffer every torment in this world

03:55.930 --> 03:58.030
and then kill them

03:58.050 --> 04:00.020
to join you in death.

04:09.080 --> 04:11.720
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

04:13.810 --> 04:14.890
- Come on.
- Be careful.

04:14.890 --> 04:16.860
This vase must be held properly.

04:16.860 --> 04:18.440
Don't handle it carelessly.

04:18.890 --> 04:20.330
Come on.

04:21.740 --> 04:23.500
Didn't I tell you all?

04:23.520 --> 04:24.600
This tea cup set

04:24.600 --> 04:26.620
needs to have a celadon glaze.

04:26.640 --> 04:29.000
Why is it still the same old set?

04:29.400 --> 04:32.700
Prince and Princess Yan
will come back today.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.060
Be sure to handle

04:34.080 --> 04:35.840
everything gently.

04:35.840 --> 04:36.840
- Be careful.
- Yes.

04:36.840 --> 04:38.180
Look at him.

04:38.200 --> 04:39.640
Grandmother,

04:40.440 --> 04:41.680
Si is family.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.440
She won't mind these things.

04:43.960 --> 04:45.980
She's a Princess Consort now.

04:46.000 --> 04:48.420
What should be done must be done.

04:48.440 --> 04:49.760
The necessary rules

04:49.760 --> 04:51.300
must be observed.

04:51.320 --> 04:52.940
Grandmother, you're right.

04:52.960 --> 04:54.400
Grandmother.

04:55.480 --> 04:56.760
- Zhan.
- Father.

04:56.760 --> 04:57.700
Yi.

04:57.720 --> 04:58.620
Zhan.

04:58.620 --> 05:00.400
It's so lively here.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.240
This is for Princess Yan.

05:03.260 --> 05:04.440
I'll try it on her behalf.

05:04.440 --> 05:06.000
What a glutton.

05:19.200 --> 05:21.120
Greetings, Grandmother.

05:22.720 --> 05:23.800
Greetings, Father.

05:23.800 --> 05:25.240
Good, good.

05:29.040 --> 05:31.900
Grandmother, please have my tea.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.400
Good.

05:37.080 --> 05:40.440
Father, please have my tea.

05:43.480 --> 05:44.940
From now on,

05:44.960 --> 05:47.060
we are all family.

05:47.080 --> 05:48.180
Thank you, Grandmother.

05:48.200 --> 05:51.220
Remember to take care of each other.

05:51.240 --> 05:52.780
Yes, Grandmother.

05:52.800 --> 05:53.960
Don't worry

05:53.960 --> 05:55.900
about anything else.

05:55.920 --> 05:57.040
Just focus on the life

05:57.040 --> 05:58.460
between you two.

05:58.480 --> 06:00.700
That's the most important thing.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.320
Good, good.

06:10.160 --> 06:12.460
We've lived here for so many years,

06:12.480 --> 06:13.680
but now we have to move

06:13.680 --> 06:14.820
to the new house.

06:14.840 --> 06:16.340
I'll miss it.

06:16.360 --> 06:18.120
I'll miss it too.

06:19.600 --> 06:21.780
But even after we leave here,

06:21.800 --> 06:24.260
this place will always be our home.

06:24.280 --> 06:25.700
If we ever miss home,

06:25.720 --> 06:27.400
we'll just come back.

06:30.960 --> 06:31.800
Si.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.240
Yi.

06:33.720 --> 06:34.360
I embroidered

06:34.360 --> 06:35.580
a mandarin duck quilt for you.

06:35.600 --> 06:37.480
It's a bit bigger than the one
you had before.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.320
Thank you, Yi.

06:38.320 --> 06:39.960
How thoughtful of you.

06:42.880 --> 06:44.960
This is the first time
Prince Yan is staying here.

06:44.980 --> 06:46.130
If there's anything you need,

06:46.140 --> 06:47.500
just tell the butler.

06:47.520 --> 06:48.480
Yi.

06:48.480 --> 06:49.400
His Highness and we

06:49.400 --> 06:50.580
are family now.

06:50.600 --> 06:52.140
No need to be so polite.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.940
I need to tell you something.

06:54.960 --> 06:57.300
The Grand Princess has kept it quiet,

06:57.320 --> 06:58.800
but I think

06:59.880 --> 07:01.680
you should know.

07:02.080 --> 07:03.540
On the day of the wedding,

07:03.560 --> 07:05.380
Zhu Ziyu interrupted
the wedding procession

07:05.400 --> 07:07.060
and wanted to marry Cui Mingyue.

07:07.080 --> 07:08.960
On their wedding night,

07:10.600 --> 07:12.480
he killed Cui Mingyue.

07:21.880 --> 07:23.480
Mother...

07:30.400 --> 07:33.680
He set himself on fire?

07:38.040 --> 07:39.720
How could this happen?

07:43.280 --> 07:44.200
Is it because

07:44.200 --> 07:45.840
of what I said to him?

07:47.640 --> 07:48.780
Miss,

07:48.800 --> 07:50.440
Zhu Ziyu is here.

07:52.400 --> 07:53.840
Yi.

07:54.880 --> 07:56.520
Why are you here?

07:57.920 --> 07:59.680
I came to check on Yan.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.680
You've spent all the money

08:07.200 --> 08:09.600
on candied treats and fruits?

08:25.480 --> 08:27.520
With that marriage edict,

08:27.640 --> 08:29.280
Cui Mingyue is even more reckless.

08:29.300 --> 08:30.380
When Si and I were waiting

08:30.380 --> 08:32.220
for Prince Yan
outside the Palace yesterday,

08:32.240 --> 08:34.380
she came to threaten Si

08:34.400 --> 08:36.300
that she'd do everything to torment her

08:36.320 --> 08:37.960
after the wedding.

08:37.960 --> 08:40.000
She's a madwoman.

08:41.200 --> 08:43.180
She'd definitely do something like that.

08:43.200 --> 08:44.660
She won't even spare

08:44.680 --> 08:46.020
the Jiang family.

08:46.040 --> 08:47.540
Back when we were in Lingshui,

08:47.560 --> 08:49.600
she tried to kill you.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.680
At that time, Yan and you

08:52.600 --> 08:54.100
might be dragged into it.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.860
If anyone dares to harm Yan

08:55.880 --> 08:57.440
or Si,

08:57.600 --> 08:59.320
I'll fight them to the death.

09:12.640 --> 09:14.100
Zhu Ziyu has done so many things

09:14.120 --> 09:16.560
to betray you.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.240
But in the end, he came to his senses

09:19.280 --> 09:20.580
and died protecting you.

09:20.600 --> 09:21.560
Yi,

09:21.560 --> 09:23.120
the dead are gone.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.640
You should let go now.

09:28.880 --> 09:31.260
Father, I miss you so much.

09:31.280 --> 09:32.580
Yan,

09:32.600 --> 09:34.380
I miss you too.

09:34.400 --> 09:35.360
Father,

09:35.360 --> 09:38.360
can you play with me every day
in the future?

09:40.680 --> 09:42.320
I promise you

09:42.480 --> 09:43.540
that from now on,

09:43.560 --> 09:45.300
I'll play with you every day.

09:45.320 --> 09:46.400
Shall we swing on the swing?

09:46.400 --> 09:47.840
Alright.

09:48.680 --> 09:50.540
- Yan, hold on tight.
- Sure.

09:50.560 --> 09:51.860
Do you want to go higher?

09:51.880 --> 09:52.880
Is it fun?

09:52.880 --> 09:54.320
Yes.

09:56.240 --> 09:58.360
Yan, hold on tight.

09:59.680 --> 10:01.460
Higher.

10:01.480 --> 10:03.640
Alright, hold tight.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.600
Are you happy?

10:05.840 --> 10:08.400
(Yan, promise me)

10:08.520 --> 10:10.060
(that when you grow up, )

10:10.080 --> 10:11.880
(you'll be good to Mother, )

10:12.080 --> 10:12.960
(okay?)

10:12.960 --> 10:14.400
(Got it.)

10:17.750 --> 10:25.560
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

10:50.060 --> 10:53.790
♪ Spring is as green ♪

10:53.810 --> 10:57.100
♪ In vain she's lean ♪

10:57.220 --> 11:04.320
♪ Her kerchief soaked with tears,
red with stains unclean ♪

11:04.520 --> 11:08.060
♪ Peach blossoms fall ♪

11:08.080 --> 11:11.570
♪ Near deserted hall ♪

11:11.590 --> 11:17.930
♪ Our oath is still there, lo ♪

11:17.950 --> 11:25.420
♪ No words to her can go ♪

11:26.080 --> 11:30.440
♪ No, no, no ♪

11:30.440 --> 11:33.960
(Haitang Chamber)

11:40.800 --> 11:42.240
Your Highness.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.840
When did you become so polite,

11:46.840 --> 11:48.800
calling me that?

11:49.120 --> 11:50.700
You must not call me that.

11:50.960 --> 11:52.500
You should call me Honey.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.940
Alright, honey.

11:54.960 --> 11:56.600
Darling, please sit.

11:57.560 --> 11:59.180
Why did you take so long?

11:59.200 --> 12:00.980
How's the chat with Father?

12:01.000 --> 12:02.780
When you hadn't come back,

12:02.800 --> 12:03.720
I thought you might've

12:03.720 --> 12:05.280
lost your way back.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.880
You must be kidding.

12:07.280 --> 12:10.040
This is also my home now.

12:10.240 --> 12:12.800
I had a wonderful time tonight.

12:13.720 --> 12:15.160
They're my father

12:15.160 --> 12:17.000
and my brother-in-law.

12:17.360 --> 12:19.000
I'm glad you had a good time.

12:28.280 --> 12:30.340
Your eyes are telling me

12:30.360 --> 12:32.960
you're a bit sad.

12:35.560 --> 12:37.360
When I was packing,

12:37.880 --> 12:39.680
I thought about all the years

12:40.080 --> 12:41.880
I spent here,

12:43.160 --> 12:45.760
and now I have to leave.

12:48.200 --> 12:50.200
So, I'm having a hard time.

12:53.920 --> 12:54.880
Actually,

12:54.880 --> 12:57.540
I've always had a little wish

12:57.560 --> 12:59.480
that I've never told you.

13:00.840 --> 13:02.640
I want to live in your home.

13:03.760 --> 13:05.240
Don't talk nonsense.

13:05.640 --> 13:07.720
How about this?

13:08.160 --> 13:09.740
Every now and then,

13:09.760 --> 13:11.040
we can come here to reminisce

13:11.040 --> 13:12.580
and stay for a few days.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.280
Thank you, honey.

13:16.480 --> 13:17.360
I almost forgot

13:17.360 --> 13:19.440
I want to show you something.

13:19.640 --> 13:21.080
What is it?

13:23.660 --> 13:26.060
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

13:26.080 --> 13:29.740
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall
and take root ♪

13:29.760 --> 13:33.180
♪ Growing between us ♪

13:33.330 --> 13:38.850
♪ And breeding love ♪

13:39.670 --> 13:43.350
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

13:43.350 --> 13:47.580
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

13:47.600 --> 13:49.380
♪ Time glows ♪

13:49.380 --> 13:53.920
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

13:53.940 --> 13:58.740
♪ And stars ♪

13:59.800 --> 14:07.320
(Haitang Chamber)

14:11.320 --> 14:13.680
(Grand Princess's Mansion)
I finally found out.

14:13.700 --> 14:14.760
The night Jiang Si treated

14:14.760 --> 14:16.340
Princess Fuqing's eyes,

14:16.360 --> 14:17.320
she and Ms. Duo

14:17.320 --> 14:19.460
went to the Imperial Pharmacy together.

14:19.480 --> 14:21.300
It was Ms. Duo who told Jiang Si

14:21.320 --> 14:22.960
which herb to take.

14:23.360 --> 14:27.160
How dare Ms. Duo betray me?

14:28.680 --> 14:29.680
At that time, Jiang Si

14:29.680 --> 14:31.840
wasn't even a Princess Consort.

14:31.880 --> 14:34.020
What benefits could

14:34.040 --> 14:36.520
an Earl's daughter promise?

14:36.560 --> 14:38.340
How could she manage

14:38.360 --> 14:40.120
to buy her off from me?

14:40.120 --> 14:41.500
I don't know.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.960
You may leave.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.240
Shijiu.

14:47.240 --> 14:48.680
Here.

14:48.840 --> 14:50.700
Any news from those sent

14:50.720 --> 14:52.220
to eliminate Xiao?

14:52.240 --> 14:54.100
They reported back last night.

14:54.120 --> 14:55.880
They've confirmed everything.

14:55.960 --> 14:57.400
It should be done soon.

14:57.600 --> 14:59.320
Send someone to keep an eye on Ms. Duo.

14:59.320 --> 15:00.600
As soon as she leaves the Palace,

15:00.600 --> 15:02.820
find a chance to capture her.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.280
Also,

15:04.520 --> 15:06.740
you go and keep an eye on Jiang Si

15:06.760 --> 15:07.880
and see what her relationship

15:07.880 --> 15:09.840
with Nanwu really is.

15:10.040 --> 15:11.480
Understood.

15:19.120 --> 15:20.800
Uncle Anmou is really clever.

15:20.800 --> 15:22.240
He wrote a letter

15:22.240 --> 15:23.400
and put it in the gifts

15:23.400 --> 15:24.840
we brought back.

15:25.080 --> 15:26.420
What did it say?

15:26.440 --> 15:27.280
Just some

15:27.280 --> 15:29.060
formal and flattering wishes.

15:29.080 --> 15:30.080
In the end, it suggests

15:30.080 --> 15:32.760
that family members
should help each other.

15:33.000 --> 15:34.660
He wants you to speak well of him

15:34.680 --> 15:36.180
in front of the Emperor,

15:36.200 --> 15:38.340
so he can get promoted.

15:38.360 --> 15:39.280
Ms. Xiao

15:39.280 --> 15:40.800
used to treat us so poorly.

15:40.800 --> 15:42.540
How could he still say that?

15:42.560 --> 15:44.040
He couldn't talk to us directly,

15:44.040 --> 15:45.760
so he wrote it in the letter.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.800
What's wrong?

15:53.360 --> 15:54.540
The Grand Princess's men

15:54.560 --> 15:55.900
are following closer.

15:55.920 --> 15:57.920
Has she started to suspect my identity?

15:57.920 --> 15:59.780
We must be even more cautious.

15:59.800 --> 16:01.340
The Grand Princess is about to move,

16:01.360 --> 16:02.480
so Xiao and Ms. Duo

16:02.480 --> 16:03.660
must be in danger.

16:03.680 --> 16:04.980
We need to protect them.

16:05.000 --> 16:06.440
Let's head back first.

16:15.710 --> 16:16.560
Qian,

16:16.560 --> 16:17.680
can you adapt to the life

16:17.680 --> 16:18.560
in the countryside?

16:18.560 --> 16:19.940
Sure.

16:19.960 --> 16:20.920
Though the farm life

16:20.920 --> 16:22.220
is harder than our life

16:22.240 --> 16:23.820
back at the mansion,

16:23.840 --> 16:25.720
it's much more peaceful.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.100
As long as I'm with you,

16:27.120 --> 16:28.320
I'm happy no matter where I am.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.820
Brother also sent word

16:29.840 --> 16:31.160
that he'll visit us in a few days.

16:31.160 --> 16:32.600
Come on.

16:33.120 --> 16:35.000
Alright, you got water on my face.

16:43.680 --> 16:46.200
Sir, who are you?

16:46.520 --> 16:47.740
Qian,

16:47.760 --> 16:49.660
they're sent by the Grand Princess.

16:49.680 --> 16:50.600
Run!

16:50.600 --> 16:53.000
By order of Her Highness,
leave no survivors.

16:56.830 --> 16:57.680
Qian,

16:57.680 --> 16:58.900
- hurry
- Open the door.

16:58.920 --> 16:59.840
through the back door.

16:59.840 --> 17:00.720
I won't.

17:00.720 --> 17:01.940
We should run together.

17:01.960 --> 17:03.720
The two of us can't escape together.

17:03.720 --> 17:05.280
I won't leave. Mother, I won't.

17:05.280 --> 17:06.720
Run!

17:08.040 --> 17:09.480
Mother!

17:24.920 --> 17:26.360
Mother...

17:33.480 --> 17:34.920
Mother!

17:43.960 --> 17:45.220
Mother...

17:45.240 --> 17:47.920
Qian, don't cry.

17:50.880 --> 17:52.400
I can't move anymore.

17:53.280 --> 17:55.140
It seems like I can't stay
with you anymore.

17:55.160 --> 17:57.300
Mother, you'll be fine.

17:57.320 --> 17:59.040
We'll go back
to Earl Dongping's Mansion.

17:59.040 --> 18:01.240
You'll be fine, Mother.

18:02.480 --> 18:03.540
Mother...

18:03.560 --> 18:06.160
I've done many wrong things.

18:08.120 --> 18:12.680
This is

18:13.480 --> 18:15.200
my punishment.

18:17.840 --> 18:19.480
Qian,

18:20.720 --> 18:22.560
after you return to the mansion,

18:23.360 --> 18:27.880
tell your uncle and Jiang Si

18:30.440 --> 18:32.960
that I can never repay

18:35.200 --> 18:37.320
my debt to them.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.440
Mother, I...

18:41.440 --> 18:43.520
In my next life,

18:44.920 --> 18:47.280
I'll do everything I can

18:48.320 --> 18:50.660
to repay their kindness.

18:50.680 --> 18:51.840
Mother, you can't die.

18:51.840 --> 18:53.740
You can't leave me.

18:53.760 --> 18:54.800
Don't leave me.

18:54.800 --> 18:56.240
Captain Xie,

18:58.560 --> 19:00.520
please send Qian

19:01.400 --> 19:03.560
back to Earl Dongping's Mansion.

19:07.840 --> 19:10.800
Mother, don't die. Mother.

19:13.200 --> 19:15.560
Don't leave me.

19:29.160 --> 19:30.740
We've arrived at Ling'an.

19:30.760 --> 19:32.400
You're safe now.

19:38.400 --> 19:41.920
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

19:56.920 --> 19:58.440
Qian.

19:59.520 --> 20:00.960
Si.

20:01.520 --> 20:02.960
Si.

20:03.480 --> 20:04.660
Qian,

20:04.680 --> 20:06.120
where's Aunt Xiao?

20:11.240 --> 20:13.200
She passed away.

20:13.560 --> 20:15.520
They killed her

20:16.200 --> 20:18.360
in front of me.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.600
How could that be?

20:20.620 --> 20:22.180
It was the Grand Princess's Iron Guard.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.860
I've failed your trust.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.340
I arrived too late.

20:25.360 --> 20:26.820
I could only save Ms. Jiang Qian.

20:26.840 --> 20:28.280
It's all my fault.

20:28.320 --> 20:29.520
If I had noticed earlier...

20:29.520 --> 20:30.960
It's not your fault.

20:31.080 --> 20:32.640
Mother died

20:32.640 --> 20:34.080
to save me.

20:35.520 --> 20:37.720
I'll make the Grand Princess

20:38.000 --> 20:39.720
pay for it.

20:39.960 --> 20:40.840
Aman,

20:40.840 --> 20:42.400
take Qian to rest inside.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.840
Yes.

20:44.040 --> 20:45.480
Miss.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.120
By the way,

20:54.120 --> 20:55.240
before Mother passed away,

20:55.240 --> 20:56.980
she wanted me to tell you

20:57.000 --> 20:59.400
that she regretted what she did

21:00.760 --> 21:02.720
and hoped you could forgive her.

21:03.560 --> 21:05.480
(It was too late.)

21:06.360 --> 21:08.260
(My identity will eventually
be exposed.)

21:08.280 --> 21:10.060
(I need to think of a plan.)

21:10.080 --> 21:11.300
(Otherwise, my family)

21:11.320 --> 21:13.560
(might be dragged into it
because of me.)

21:13.640 --> 21:17.840
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

21:24.720 --> 21:25.780
Mother.

21:25.800 --> 21:27.440
Mother, you...

21:31.440 --> 21:33.480
Greetings, Princess Yan.

21:34.840 --> 21:36.060
Mother,

21:36.080 --> 21:38.060
you sent someone to call me back.

21:38.080 --> 21:39.780
Is there something urgent?

21:39.800 --> 21:42.160
He's here.

21:44.760 --> 21:46.640
Princess Yan, you wanted to see me?

21:47.040 --> 21:48.340
Uncle Anmou,

21:48.360 --> 21:49.680
I recently heard

21:49.680 --> 21:51.340
you've been telling people

21:51.360 --> 21:53.320
that Prince Yan is your son-in-law.

21:53.480 --> 21:56.520
What are you up to?

21:58.520 --> 21:59.910
What's wrong with that?

21:59.930 --> 22:02.960
He's my nephew-in-law after all.

22:03.000 --> 22:04.440
Right, Ancheng?

22:05.320 --> 22:07.100
I've warned you many times.

22:07.120 --> 22:08.800
You can't use Prince Yan's name

22:08.800 --> 22:10.180
to spread rumors outside.

22:10.200 --> 22:12.100
The political world is complicated.

22:12.120 --> 22:14.260
Talking too much will be bad for them.

22:14.280 --> 22:15.300
Mother,

22:15.320 --> 22:17.080
even if I hadn't said that...

22:19.120 --> 22:21.420
Si and your brother are right.

22:21.440 --> 22:22.740
Anmou,

22:22.760 --> 22:25.580
this was a foolish thing to do.

22:25.600 --> 22:27.740
As Si married Prince Yan,

22:27.760 --> 22:28.760
your every word and deed

22:28.760 --> 22:29.840
may be seen by others

22:29.840 --> 22:33.100
as related to Prince Yan.

22:33.120 --> 22:34.920
Go apologize to Prince Yan,

22:34.920 --> 22:37.440
and don't let it happen again.

22:38.840 --> 22:40.280
Yes.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.400
Uncle Anmou,

22:43.680 --> 22:47.220
what is this letter about?

22:47.240 --> 22:48.680
What letter?

22:49.960 --> 22:51.480
Anmou.

22:53.840 --> 22:55.720
No, this letter...

22:58.720 --> 22:59.900
Si, now that you've become

22:59.920 --> 23:01.420
Princess Yan,

23:01.420 --> 23:03.120
have you lost all respect
for your elders?

23:03.120 --> 23:04.040
Uncle Anmou,

23:04.040 --> 23:05.520
do you think it's appropriate

23:05.520 --> 23:06.480
to pass me this letter?

23:06.480 --> 23:07.400
What's wrong with that?

23:07.400 --> 23:08.620
Enough.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.800
Anmou,

23:09.800 --> 23:12.340
you asked Prince Yan to help you.

23:12.360 --> 23:14.720
This is what you deserve.

23:15.520 --> 23:17.000
Si,

23:17.400 --> 23:18.760
actually, your uncle

23:18.760 --> 23:19.840
is not a man driven

23:19.840 --> 23:21.500
by greed for fame or wealth.

23:21.520 --> 23:25.020
I think this was
just an unintended mistake.

23:25.040 --> 23:26.600
I only want what's best for our family.

23:26.600 --> 23:28.320
Stop it.

23:29.040 --> 23:30.120
Today,

23:30.120 --> 23:31.540
you already scolded him

23:31.560 --> 23:33.400
in front of everyone.

23:33.560 --> 23:37.020
Why not let it go?

23:37.040 --> 23:38.900
Can you do that for me?

23:38.920 --> 23:40.040
Grandmother, do you think

23:40.040 --> 23:41.260
this is a small matter?

23:41.280 --> 23:43.280
Did you encourage Uncle Anmou

23:43.280 --> 23:44.860
to beg me

23:44.880 --> 23:48.180
for an official position?

23:48.200 --> 23:49.160
Of course not.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.900
Then what do you mean, Uncle Anmou?

23:50.920 --> 23:51.980
Si,

23:52.000 --> 23:54.140
how can you talk
to your grandmother like this?

23:54.160 --> 23:57.900
Have you gone too far?

23:57.920 --> 24:00.260
You're a Princess Consort
and our family,

24:00.280 --> 24:02.040
so we respect you,

24:02.040 --> 24:03.440
but we won't beg you

24:03.440 --> 24:05.100
or be afraid of you.

24:05.120 --> 24:06.520
If you still remember

24:06.520 --> 24:08.840
our teachings and kindness,

24:08.860 --> 24:09.800
you should be mediating

24:09.800 --> 24:11.200
for your uncle

24:11.200 --> 24:12.440
even if he didn't

24:12.440 --> 24:13.840
ask for it.

24:13.840 --> 24:15.280
Mediate for him?

24:15.880 --> 24:18.340
Uncle Anmou, ask yourself.

24:18.360 --> 24:19.720
What has your family done

24:19.720 --> 24:20.600
for my family

24:20.600 --> 24:22.100
all these years?

24:22.120 --> 24:23.120
Your wife

24:23.120 --> 24:24.380
killed my mother.

24:24.400 --> 24:25.480
Your daughter knew

24:25.480 --> 24:27.300
that her husband was violent

24:27.300 --> 24:28.700
but still sent me into his grasp.

24:28.720 --> 24:29.640
What about you?

24:29.640 --> 24:31.280
Have you ever respected my father?

24:31.280 --> 24:32.140
Have you ever cared

24:32.140 --> 24:33.120
about my siblings and me?

24:33.120 --> 24:33.970
Now, you claim

24:33.980 --> 24:36.140
we're family and want to smooth it over.

24:36.160 --> 24:37.360
It's too late.

24:37.380 --> 24:39.040
How impudent!

24:39.350 --> 24:40.240
Mother...

24:40.240 --> 24:42.340
Being a Princess Consort
doesn't give you

24:42.360 --> 24:44.520
the right to do whatever you want.

24:44.520 --> 24:47.400
However wrong your uncle is,

24:47.400 --> 24:50.180
he's still your father's brother.

24:50.200 --> 24:51.860
How can you

24:51.880 --> 24:53.700
step on his dignity

24:53.720 --> 24:54.880
and scold him like this?

24:54.880 --> 24:57.560
I'm not dead yet.

24:57.760 --> 24:59.200
Grandmother,

24:59.360 --> 25:00.960
for all these years,

25:01.200 --> 25:03.160
I've always felt
that you favored Uncle Anmou

25:03.160 --> 25:04.860
and his family

25:04.880 --> 25:06.520
because he's an official

25:06.540 --> 25:07.560
and you're relying on him

25:07.560 --> 25:08.980
to support the family.

25:09.000 --> 25:11.480
But now, I see that's not it at all.

25:11.520 --> 25:12.980
You simply favor him

25:13.000 --> 25:14.780
without reason.

25:14.800 --> 25:16.040
You like Uncle Anmou

25:16.040 --> 25:17.540
more than you like my father.

25:17.560 --> 25:20.200
Today, you'd rather offend
a Princess Consort

25:20.200 --> 25:22.360
than speak out for him.

25:22.440 --> 25:24.460
Xiao was right.

25:24.480 --> 25:26.260
My mother's death

25:26.280 --> 25:27.600
is also related

25:27.600 --> 25:28.640
to you two.

25:28.640 --> 25:29.760
You're the most selfish

25:29.760 --> 25:31.760
mother and son in this world.

25:31.760 --> 25:33.280
- You...
- Fine.

25:33.280 --> 25:37.120
Then I'll wish you two live in harmony.

25:40.400 --> 25:43.440
Oh, my deceased husband...

25:43.440 --> 25:44.840
- Mother.
- How could our family

25:44.840 --> 25:47.340
have such a granddaughter?

25:47.340 --> 25:48.280
Mother, get up.

25:48.280 --> 25:49.540
You can't kneel.

25:49.560 --> 25:51.580
Get up, Mother.

25:51.600 --> 25:53.040
Mother.

25:54.360 --> 25:58.080
Ancheng, Ancheng.

25:59.060 --> 26:00.080
This is your good daughter

26:00.080 --> 26:04.040
whom you've raised for many years.

26:04.560 --> 26:07.320
Si, stop talking.

26:07.360 --> 26:09.500
Father, if you want,

26:09.520 --> 26:11.460
come with me to Prince Yan's Mansion.

26:11.480 --> 26:12.900
From now on,

26:12.920 --> 26:14.820
we can live separately,

26:14.840 --> 26:17.120
and we'll have nothing to do

26:17.240 --> 26:18.940
with them.

26:18.960 --> 26:20.660
You're being unfilial.

26:20.680 --> 26:22.700
You're giving up our family.

26:22.720 --> 26:23.600
Ancheng,

26:23.600 --> 26:25.960
you can't go with her.

26:26.240 --> 26:28.280
Jiang Ancheng,

26:28.720 --> 26:32.040
are you really going to leave here

26:32.560 --> 26:35.240
and your mother

26:35.880 --> 26:40.200
to enjoy fame and fortune?

26:42.360 --> 26:45.600
Mother, I won't go.

26:45.800 --> 26:46.820
Si,

26:46.840 --> 26:49.380
you were raised here.

26:49.400 --> 26:50.400
Without your grandmother,

26:50.400 --> 26:51.700
how would you exist?

26:51.720 --> 26:52.820
Why do you have

26:52.840 --> 26:55.240
to make this decision so decisively?

26:55.240 --> 26:57.840
How could you go this far?

27:06.560 --> 27:08.720
I will never forget

27:09.080 --> 27:10.700
how you treated me before.

27:10.720 --> 27:12.840
Now that I'm married,

27:12.860 --> 27:13.800
I don't want to be bound

27:13.800 --> 27:15.920
by you guys anymore.

27:24.440 --> 27:26.840
You're just

27:27.000 --> 27:29.240
an ignorant

27:29.520 --> 27:32.520
and ungrateful girl.

27:33.560 --> 27:36.360
I don't have a granddaughter like you.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.320
I've long had enough

27:39.320 --> 27:41.520
of having you as my grandmother.

27:45.280 --> 27:46.900
As things have come to this,

27:47.400 --> 27:49.020
go fetch the family seal.

27:49.020 --> 27:50.800
Let's write the Letter
of Disownment today.

27:50.800 --> 27:51.800
As you wish.

27:51.800 --> 27:52.960
Go fetch the family seal.

27:52.960 --> 27:54.240
Don't.

27:54.240 --> 27:55.620
It's not necessary.

27:55.640 --> 27:57.280
Fu.

28:02.080 --> 28:04.100
(Grandmother, Father.)

28:04.120 --> 28:05.700
(Sorry.)

28:05.720 --> 28:07.760
(I have no choice.)

28:12.640 --> 28:14.080
Stop.

28:15.000 --> 28:17.180
(Changning Palace)
By the Empress's command,

28:17.200 --> 28:17.880
I need to go

28:17.880 --> 28:20.180
to Qingyin Temple to pray
on the 15th day of every month.

28:20.200 --> 28:21.640
Go then.

28:35.920 --> 28:37.560
I've met the Saintess.

28:38.040 --> 28:40.000
She won't return with me to Nanwu.

28:40.280 --> 28:42.180
She's become Princess Yan,

28:42.200 --> 28:44.120
deeply in love with Prince Yan.

28:44.160 --> 28:45.540
How could she bear to part?

28:45.560 --> 28:47.500
Prince Yan is the Commander
of Chiyu Cavalry.

28:47.520 --> 28:50.120
If war breaks out at the border,

28:50.240 --> 28:51.700
he will have to go back.

28:51.720 --> 28:53.460
And Princess Yan will follow.

28:53.480 --> 28:55.580
Once they reach our territory,

28:55.600 --> 28:57.780
it will be much easier to bring

28:57.800 --> 28:59.360
the Saintess back to Nanwu.

29:00.080 --> 29:01.920
I'll inform the Grand Elder.

29:16.520 --> 29:19.160
This pattern looks strange.

29:19.180 --> 29:22.010
Could it be hiding some secret?

29:22.030 --> 29:25.050
Does it resemble Nanwu's Flame Totem?

29:25.070 --> 29:29.080
Could Jiang Si be from Nanwu?

29:29.120 --> 29:30.800
That's impossible.

29:31.020 --> 29:33.770
Su Ke gave birth to her in Ling'an,

29:33.790 --> 29:37.080
and Jiang Si was raised in Ling'an.

29:39.300 --> 29:41.700
Go and ask our informants

29:41.720 --> 29:43.720
about the origin

29:44.000 --> 29:45.620
of this totem.

29:45.640 --> 29:46.980
Yes.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.080
Earlier, you said

29:48.080 --> 29:49.580
our people

29:49.600 --> 29:50.800
found Ms. Duo

29:50.810 --> 29:52.640
at Qingyin Temple.

29:52.840 --> 29:53.860
Keep an eye on her.

29:53.880 --> 29:55.640
Get her back to see me asap.

29:55.640 --> 29:57.080
Yes.

30:04.880 --> 30:06.320
What do you want?

30:06.480 --> 30:08.160
This is the imperial carriage.

30:09.720 --> 30:12.260
Ms. Duo, the Grand Princess
wants to see you.

30:12.280 --> 30:13.960
Come with us.

30:22.920 --> 30:24.360
Chase!

30:28.760 --> 30:29.860
Stop.

30:29.880 --> 30:30.760
Don't run.

30:30.760 --> 30:32.200
Stop.

30:42.760 --> 30:44.200
Wait.

30:47.240 --> 30:48.680
What's going on?

30:48.960 --> 30:50.380
We're about to enter the city.

30:50.400 --> 30:51.360
We can't go together.

30:51.380 --> 30:53.600
The Grand Princess sent the Iron Guard
to deal with you.

30:53.600 --> 30:56.010
Returning to the Palace
would be like walking into a trap.

30:56.030 --> 30:56.840
Why not stay outside?

30:56.840 --> 30:58.140
The Grand Princess will at least

30:58.160 --> 31:00.380
have some reservations
at the Empress's Palace.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.580
But if I'm outside the city,

31:01.600 --> 31:03.280
she can act with impunity.

31:03.810 --> 31:04.890
I have something important

31:04.890 --> 31:05.980
in Changning Palace.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.880
I must return to retrieve it.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.120
Be careful.

31:15.360 --> 31:16.580
How was it?

31:16.600 --> 31:18.040
It was fine.

31:18.120 --> 31:19.760
They didn't catch Ms. Duo.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.540
That's good.

31:21.560 --> 31:22.680
Thankfully, you had Long Dan

31:22.680 --> 31:24.280
follow her.

31:24.400 --> 31:25.360
I heard from Aman today

31:25.360 --> 31:26.880
that you went back home.

31:26.920 --> 31:28.300
Why did you have a fight?

31:28.320 --> 31:29.980
Did Grandmother give you a hard time?

31:30.000 --> 31:31.820
It's I who gave her a hard time.

31:38.600 --> 31:40.360
Why?

31:40.680 --> 31:42.800
You care the most about your family.

31:44.600 --> 31:45.940
The Letter of Disownment

31:45.960 --> 31:48.880
needs the seal of Capital Security
to be valid.

31:52.240 --> 31:53.620
Got it.

31:53.640 --> 31:55.860
You don't care about that place

31:55.880 --> 31:57.560
but the people there.

32:00.240 --> 32:02.340
As long as the people you love are safe,

32:02.360 --> 32:04.280
they'll still be with you.

32:10.120 --> 32:14.640
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

32:20.680 --> 32:21.740
Your Highnesses,

32:21.760 --> 32:23.460
you're finally back.

32:23.480 --> 32:25.820
Ms. Jiang Yi
and Young Master Zhan are here.

32:27.520 --> 32:28.780
Si,

32:28.800 --> 32:30.640
why did you sever ties with the family?

32:30.640 --> 32:32.500
We've hated Uncle Anmou for a long time.

32:32.520 --> 32:33.720
It's not worth getting so upset

32:33.720 --> 32:34.960
over him.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.340
If you want to vent,

32:36.360 --> 32:37.820
let me beat him up for you.

32:37.840 --> 32:40.120
Don't sever ties with me.

32:42.120 --> 32:42.960
Yu,

32:42.960 --> 32:44.840
speak for me.

32:50.600 --> 32:52.040
Zhan.

32:55.080 --> 32:57.420
Si, what's going on?

32:57.440 --> 32:58.960
Tell me.

33:04.960 --> 33:07.740
I've made up my mind.

33:07.760 --> 33:09.200
If you want,

33:09.320 --> 33:11.460
you'll still be my brother and sister.

33:11.480 --> 33:13.000
But that mansion

33:13.520 --> 33:15.040
is no longer my home.

33:15.120 --> 33:17.720
From now on,

33:18.400 --> 33:20.240
this place is my only home.

33:20.640 --> 33:22.140
What do you mean?

33:22.160 --> 33:23.300
Si,

33:23.320 --> 33:25.120
is there something you're hiding?

33:25.120 --> 33:27.180
There's no one else here,
only me and Zhan.

33:27.200 --> 33:29.280
You can tell us.

33:32.720 --> 33:34.440
She's not hiding anything.

33:35.160 --> 33:36.660
Before, in your house,

33:36.680 --> 33:38.740
she had to endure and suffer.

33:38.760 --> 33:40.060
Now that she's married me,

33:40.080 --> 33:41.820
she doesn't have to endure anymore.

33:41.840 --> 33:43.840
But I can assure you

33:44.920 --> 33:46.560
I will take good care of her.

33:46.880 --> 33:49.400
I grew up with my sister.

33:50.680 --> 33:52.620
No one understands better than I do

33:52.640 --> 33:54.460
what hardships and suffering

33:54.480 --> 33:56.350
she has endured.

33:56.370 --> 33:57.720
She suffered enough in your house,

33:57.720 --> 33:58.360
didn't she?

33:58.360 --> 33:59.180
She's my sister.

33:59.180 --> 34:00.500
I don't care about your opinion.

34:00.500 --> 34:01.760
Jiang Zhan, this is my mansion.

34:01.760 --> 34:03.120
Your nobility won't intimidate me!

34:03.120 --> 34:04.300
Zhan!

34:04.320 --> 34:05.760
Let go.

34:19.440 --> 34:20.920
In that case,

34:22.640 --> 34:24.440
we won't disturb you any longer.

34:24.840 --> 34:26.280
Si,

34:26.400 --> 34:28.280
I won't believe a word

34:28.440 --> 34:30.480
of what you said tonight.

34:31.080 --> 34:32.220
I only believe in the sister

34:32.220 --> 34:34.560
I know and understand.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.760
You said you weren't hiding anything,

34:37.080 --> 34:39.000
but I don't believe it.

34:40.520 --> 34:42.560
Maybe you think it's too grave

34:43.400 --> 34:45.400
for us to bear.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.160
Or maybe you think

34:47.160 --> 34:48.620
we can't help you.

34:48.640 --> 34:50.280
But no matter what,

34:51.400 --> 34:53.360
I won't force you to tell us.

34:54.040 --> 34:55.680
Just remember:

34:57.120 --> 34:59.600
Even if you've written
the Letter of Disownment,

35:01.080 --> 35:03.440
we will always be your family.

35:04.960 --> 35:07.440
This door will always be open for you.

35:13.120 --> 35:14.560
Yi,

35:16.640 --> 35:18.240
how is Father?

35:19.560 --> 35:21.440
Father sent us here.

36:10.280 --> 36:11.880
I understand.

36:13.320 --> 36:15.360
Once this is over,

36:16.240 --> 36:18.080
I'll go home with you.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.040
Your Highness,

36:44.040 --> 36:45.680
we've searched everywhere in the Palace

36:45.700 --> 36:47.560
but still can't find Ms. Duo.

36:47.820 --> 36:50.710
I truly underestimated her.

36:53.240 --> 36:54.700
As long as the Empress

36:54.720 --> 36:57.100
and Fuqing don't come forward
as witnesses,

36:57.120 --> 36:59.840
Ms. Duo can't stir up any trouble.

37:02.360 --> 37:03.840
(Mingyue, )

37:04.150 --> 37:05.760
(I won't let go)

37:06.560 --> 37:09.080
(of anyone who harmed you.)

37:09.600 --> 37:13.120
(Peace and Prosperity)

37:23.880 --> 37:25.320
Your Highness,

37:25.520 --> 37:27.060
I have something to say.

37:27.960 --> 37:29.480
You may leave now.

37:30.240 --> 37:31.680
Yes.

37:34.120 --> 37:35.720
Stand up.

37:38.160 --> 37:39.460
I'm guilty.

37:39.480 --> 37:42.240
I'm the one who blinded Princess Fuqing

37:42.440 --> 37:44.960
and killed the late Empress.

37:50.960 --> 37:52.460
You already knew?

37:52.480 --> 37:56.120
During Princess Yan's investigation,

37:56.800 --> 37:59.300
she suspected you and Ms. Hua.

37:59.320 --> 38:00.280
Moreover,

38:00.280 --> 38:01.520
when Princess Yan helped Fuqing

38:01.520 --> 38:03.060
remove the poison,

38:03.080 --> 38:05.040
she specifically invited you along.

38:05.160 --> 38:06.960
So, I was sure

38:07.240 --> 38:10.360
you were the one who planted the worm.

38:10.380 --> 38:11.920
If that's the case,

38:12.520 --> 38:14.180
why didn't you expose me?

38:14.200 --> 38:16.440
I believe in Princess Yan.

38:16.960 --> 38:19.180
She must have a reason

38:19.200 --> 38:20.960
to keep you here.

38:21.560 --> 38:22.840
Actually, ten years ago,

38:22.840 --> 38:24.700
the night you took action,

38:24.720 --> 38:26.440
I wasn't asleep.

38:27.160 --> 38:28.780
I heard you say,

38:28.800 --> 38:30.380
"Your Highness,"

38:30.400 --> 38:31.880
"only if you can't see anything"

38:31.880 --> 38:33.480
"can you save your life."

38:33.600 --> 38:35.640
Your Highness, you already knew.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.720
Princess Fuqing,

38:45.800 --> 38:47.240
Your Highness,

38:47.720 --> 38:49.500
you are too kind

38:49.520 --> 38:50.880
to end well

38:50.880 --> 38:52.680
in this cold palace.

38:52.880 --> 38:55.480
You're a spy here,

38:55.680 --> 38:58.180
always looking indifferent,

38:58.200 --> 38:59.960
but I know

39:00.240 --> 39:02.280
you have some genuine feelings

39:02.440 --> 39:04.800
for me and Fuqing.

39:06.040 --> 39:07.480
Your Highness,

39:08.240 --> 39:10.640
I've wronged you and the Princess.

39:10.760 --> 39:11.780
You are

39:11.800 --> 39:14.320
a knife of the Grand Princess

39:15.080 --> 39:17.480
but also a proof of her crimes.

39:17.560 --> 39:18.900
Ms. Duo,

39:18.920 --> 39:21.300
the Crown Princess is my niece.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.960
You can trust her.

39:23.280 --> 39:25.000
I can send her

39:25.360 --> 39:27.320
to help you hide outside the Palace.

39:27.440 --> 39:28.620
Your Highness,

39:28.640 --> 39:29.640
if Ms. Duo

39:29.640 --> 39:31.440
can return to the Palace today,

39:31.720 --> 39:33.060
could you arrange for her to go

39:33.080 --> 39:34.920
to Crown Prince's Mansion to hide?

39:35.040 --> 39:35.760
Why?

39:35.760 --> 39:37.300
The Crown Prince and the Grand Princess

39:37.300 --> 39:39.060
are on the same side.

39:39.200 --> 39:40.240
Even if the Grand Princess

39:40.240 --> 39:41.880
searches the entire Ling'an,

39:41.880 --> 39:44.080
she wouldn't think to check there.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.440
Even if she finds out

39:45.440 --> 39:47.020
that the Crown Prince hid Ms. Duo,

39:47.040 --> 39:48.580
she will hesitate.

39:48.600 --> 39:50.420
(Peace and Prosperity)
There's another reason

39:50.440 --> 39:51.980
for the Crown Prince to meet Ms. Duo.

39:52.000 --> 39:52.920
It will allow Ms. Duo

39:52.920 --> 39:54.220
to tell the Crown Prince

39:54.240 --> 39:56.460
that the Grand Princess
killed the late Empress.

39:56.480 --> 39:57.880
He colluded with his mortal enemy

39:57.880 --> 39:59.320
because he thought the Grand Princess

39:59.320 --> 40:00.520
was sincere to him.

40:00.520 --> 40:02.340
If he learns the truth,

40:02.360 --> 40:03.800
I believe

40:03.920 --> 40:06.180
he'll grow distant
from the Grand Princess.

40:11.000 --> 40:14.480
(Crown Prince's Mansion)

40:29.320 --> 40:30.760
Come here.

40:40.200 --> 40:41.340
Your Highness,

40:41.360 --> 40:42.400
I've found out

40:42.400 --> 40:43.540
the origin of this totem.

40:43.560 --> 40:44.600
It's the unique symbol

40:44.600 --> 40:45.700
of Nanwu's Saintess.

40:45.720 --> 40:47.180
What?

40:47.200 --> 40:49.840
Nanwu's Saintess?

40:50.240 --> 40:52.320
No wonder Jiang Si

40:52.480 --> 40:54.440
could detoxify the Slumber Flower,

40:55.280 --> 40:57.840
cure Fuqing's eyes,

40:58.080 --> 41:02.120
and make Ms. Duo betray me.

41:02.480 --> 41:04.020
This is Nanwu's secret.

41:04.040 --> 41:05.740
I've asked our informants,

41:05.760 --> 41:06.880
and finally,

41:06.880 --> 41:08.120
from a captured Nanwu general,

41:08.120 --> 41:09.080
I learned that anyone

41:09.080 --> 41:10.080
with this mark

41:10.080 --> 41:12.600
is someone extraordinary from Nanwu.

41:12.880 --> 41:13.880
He also said

41:13.880 --> 41:15.260
that the Flame Totem becomes darker

41:15.280 --> 41:16.700
the closer it is to fire.

41:16.720 --> 41:19.320
You can determine if it's real
based on this.

41:19.880 --> 41:22.000
The Flame Totem...

41:29.040 --> 41:30.680
This show is

41:30.880 --> 41:33.480
getting more and more interesting.

41:42.700 --> 41:43.560
Aman,

41:43.560 --> 41:45.340
deliver this letter to Consort Xian.

41:45.360 --> 41:46.740
This is urgent.

41:46.760 --> 41:48.100
Go now.

41:48.120 --> 41:49.560
Sure.

41:49.600 --> 41:53.120
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

41:53.960 --> 41:56.560
Your Highness,
Prince Qi requests to see you.

41:57.000 --> 41:59.880
I'm Yu Zhang. Greetings, Aunt.

42:00.040 --> 42:00.880
You hardly

42:00.880 --> 42:03.160
pay me a visit.

42:03.280 --> 42:05.560
I've been thinking about you,

42:05.680 --> 42:07.820
but I couldn't find a good reason

42:07.840 --> 42:09.280
to come and visit.

42:11.840 --> 42:13.880
So, what's the reason now?

42:14.100 --> 42:15.080
Aunt, are you searching

42:15.080 --> 42:17.160
for Ms. Duo?

42:17.880 --> 42:20.040
I know where she is.

42:20.540 --> 42:22.880
Are you using Ms. Duo

42:23.160 --> 42:24.900
to gain favor?

42:24.920 --> 42:26.080
Ms. Duo is now hiding

42:26.080 --> 42:29.960
in Crown Prince's Mansion.

42:36.240 --> 42:38.200
Though Ms. Duo always covers her face

42:38.200 --> 42:39.640
when she comes here,

42:40.320 --> 42:42.220
there are still traces.

42:42.240 --> 42:45.640
How dare you keep an eye
on my mansion?

42:46.040 --> 42:50.320
(The End of Episode 35)

42:50.850 --> 42:52.580
♪ From place to place ♪

42:52.580 --> 42:57.520
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

42:57.890 --> 43:00.270
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:00.270 --> 43:04.500
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:05.210 --> 43:07.610
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:07.630 --> 43:11.290
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:11.310 --> 43:14.730
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:14.880 --> 43:20.400
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:21.220 --> 43:24.900
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:24.900 --> 43:28.980
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:29.220 --> 43:30.960
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:30.980 --> 43:35.680
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:35.680 --> 43:39.250
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:39.270 --> 43:43.500
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:43.520 --> 43:45.300
♪ Time glows ♪

43:45.300 --> 43:49.840
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:49.860 --> 43:54.660
♪ And stars ♪

43:58.890 --> 44:01.420
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:01.440 --> 44:05.060
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:05.080 --> 44:08.510
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:08.530 --> 44:13.150
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:13.150 --> 44:16.840
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:16.860 --> 44:20.950
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:21.060 --> 44:22.880
♪ Time glows ♪

44:22.880 --> 44:27.430
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:27.450 --> 44:31.150
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:31.170 --> 44:35.330
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:35.510 --> 44:37.270
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:37.270 --> 44:41.790
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:41.790 --> 44:45.430
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:45.450 --> 44:51.120
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:52.810 --> 44:54.740
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:54.740 --> 45:02.240
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
